<title>USA: IPO FILING -- American Medserve Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- American Medserve Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 American Medserve Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $13-$15/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5,357,000</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5,357,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    11,574,275</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    William Blair &amp; Co</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  803,550 shrs Business: Independent provider of pharmacy services to long-term care institutions.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: About $17.1 million will be used to fund a one-time mandatory preferential distribution to the principal stockholder with respect to Class A common. Also to fund a payment to an affiliate of the principal stockholder, to reduce indebtedness, to made additional investment in Good Samaritan Supply and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s, year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $44,049	    $15,008</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $405		 $520</p>
